    <!-- ===================== ABOUT ===================== -->
    <section id="about" class="about section" aria-label="About Ben Graham">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header">
          <span class="section-label">About</span>
          <h2 class="section-title">Background</h2>
        </div>
        <aside class="now-card" aria-label="Current focus">
          <span class="now-card__label">Now</span>
          <p class="now-card__body">Supporting the inspection app my colleagues use on site visits, building PropOS, and maintaining claude-skills, my open-source guardrails for Claude Code. I am also exploring full-time roles in applied AI and property technology, and I am open to conversations.</p>
          <p class="now-card__date">Updated September 2026</p>
        </aside>
        <div class="about__grid">
          <div class="about__bio">
            <div class="about__photo-wrap">
              <img src="/images/headshot-240.webp" alt="Ben Graham" class="about__photo" width="120" height="120" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
            </div>
            <p>I am a Senior Property Manager at a RICS-regulated chartered surveying firm in {{ site.locality }}. My portfolio runs from new-build blocks to Grade II listed buildings, and I lead a team of {{ site.facts.team }} property managers. The work is statutory compliance (fire, asbestos, legionella and building safety), Section 20 consultations on major works, service charge budgets of {{ site.facts.budgets }}, and supporting resident management and right to manage company boards on governance, including running their AGMs.</p>
            <p>Before that I was estate manager of a large private residential development for three and a half years, and before that I ran soft services and then the whole facilities operation at a student village. I have been the person on site and the person managing the portfolio, which is useful when the two disagree.</p>
            <p>The software started as a way to fix problems in my own job. I began the firm's AI programme on my own initiative, without a brief or a budget, and it is now part of my role as AI Development Lead. I do not have a computer science degree. I learned to build software by shipping tools that colleagues rely on, and that has made me careful about testing and about what an AI model is allowed to do unchecked.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="about__skills">
            <h3 class="about__skills-title">Areas of work</h3>
            <ul class="skills-list" role="list">
{%- for area in [
  "Residential leasehold and block management, including Section 20 and service charges",
  "Building safety and statutory compliance: fire, asbestos, legionella",
  "Facilities and estates management",
  "AI adoption: strategy, UK GDPR documentation, staff training and output checking",
  "Claude API integration: classification, vision and document generation",
  "Web and mobile development: TypeScript, React, Node.js, Supabase, Netlify, Capacitor",
  "Drone surveys of roofs and facades"
] %}
              <li class="skills-list__item">
                <span class="skills-list__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                  <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M2 8h12M8 2l6 6-6 6" stroke="#D97706" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
                </span>
                {{ area }}
              </li>
{%- endfor %}
            </ul>
            <h3 class="about__skills-title about__skills-title--spaced">Career</h3>
            <ol class="career-list" role="list">
              <li class="career-list__item"><span class="career-list__years">2024 to now</span> Senior Property Manager and AI Development Lead, RICS-regulated chartered surveying firm, {{ site.locality }}</li>
              <li class="career-list__item"><span class="career-list__years">2020 to 2024</span> Estate Manager, large private residential development, {{ site.locality }}</li>
              <li class="career-list__item"><span class="career-list__years">2017 to 2020</span> Soft Services Manager, then Facilities General Manager, student village, {{ site.locality }}</li>
              <li class="career-list__item"><span class="career-list__years">2011 to 2017</span> Security and accommodation roles, {{ site.locality }} and Gloucester</li>
            </ol>
            <p class="about__cv-link">The full history is in my <a href="/cv/ben-graham-cv.pdf" download>CV (PDF)</a>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===================== PROJECTS ===================== -->
    <section id="projects" class="projects section" aria-label="Projects">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header">
          <span class="section-label">Work</span>
          <h2 class="section-title">Projects</h2>
        </div>
{%- for project in collections.projects %}

        <article class="project-card" aria-labelledby="project-{{ loop.index }}-title">
          <div class="project-card__meta">
            <span class="project-card__number" aria-hidden="true">{{ "0" if loop.index < 10 }}{{ loop.index }}</span>
            <span class="project-card__tag">{{ project.data.tag }}</span>
          </div>
          <div class="project-card__content">
            <h3 class="project-card__title" id="project-{{ loop.index }}-title"><a href="{{ project.url }}">{{ project.data.cardTitle }}</a></h3>
            <p class="project-card__subtitle">{{ project.data.strap }}</p>
            <div class="project-card__body">
              <p>{{ project.data.summary }}</p>
            </div>
            <p class="project-card__status"><span class="project-detail__label">Status</span> {{ project.data.status }}</p>
            <p class="project-card__cta"><a href="{{ project.url }}">Read the case study<span class="visually-hidden">: {{ project.data.cardTitle }}</span></a></p>
          </div>
        </article>
{%- endfor %}

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===================== CONTACT ===================== -->
    <section id="contact" class="contact section" aria-label="Contact">
      <div class="container">
